-e3","era":null,"summary":"At her command, an orc forces Oret to his knees, and Anafenza draws the Khan-Blade.","participants":["anafenza","oret"],"location":"the-first-tree","importance":"major","page":"stories/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03","order":442,"story_date":"2014-12-03","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":31,"quote":"Anafenza ascended the dais to her throne, and slowly drew her sword, the Khan-Blade, from its scabbard.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03#:~:text=Anafenza%20ascended%20the%20dais,Khan%2DBlade%2C%20from%20its%20scabbard.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Bond and Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2014-12-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03#:~:text=Anafenza%20ascended%20the%20dais,Khan%2DBlade%2C%20from%20its%20scabbard.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Bond and Blood\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Dec 2014."}},{"id":"bond-and-blood-2014-12-03-e5","era":null,"summary":"Anafenza is introduced to her cousin Oret and to Gvar Barzeel, a krumar orc raised by her uncle after the battle that killed his Mardu parents and her cousin.","participants":["anafenza","oret","gvar-barzeel"],"location":"salt-road","importance":"minor","page":"stories/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03","order":442,"story_date":"2014-12-03","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":41,"quote":"Gvar was a krumar, which meant he was not born in the Abzan.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03#:~:text=Gvar%20was%20a%20krumar%2C,born%20in%20the%20Abzan.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Bond and Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2014-12-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03#:~:text=Gvar%20was%20a%20krumar%2C,born%20in%20the%20Abzan.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Bond and Blood\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Dec 2014."}},{"id":"bond-and-blood-2014-12-03-e6","era":null,"summary":"Oret insists the caravan continue to the capital rather than return to Kavah, citing dust storms.","participants":["oret","anafenza-s-house"],"location":"salt-road","importance":"minor","page":"stories/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03","order":442,"story_date":"2014-12-03","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":52,"quote":"I must insist we continue to the capital.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03#:~:text=I%20must%20insist%20we%20continue%20to%20the%20capital.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Bond and Blood","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2014-12-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03#:~:text=I%20must%20insist%20we%20continue%20to%20the%20capital.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Bond and Blood\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 Dec 2014."}},{"id":"bond-and-blood-2014-12-03-e17","era":null,"summary":"Interrogated, the captured attacker names Oret as the member of her house who hired the Sultai.","participants":["anafenza","gvar-barzeel","oret","sultai"],"location":"shifting-wastes","importance":"major","page":"stories/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03","order":442,"story_date":"2014-12-03","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":134,"quote":"Oret. It was Oret.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/bond-and-blood-2014-12-03#:~:text=Oret.%20It%20was%20Oret.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":tr