","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":5,"quote":"honored with the title of cartographer, and, with it, a life in exile","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Oret#:~:text=honored%20with%20the%20title,a%20life%20in%20exile","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Oret","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Oret","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Oret#:~:text=honored%20with%20the%20title,a%20life%20in%20exile","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Oret\", section \"Current timeline\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"oret-e4","era":{"date":"2015-01-23","era":"frf","label":"Fate Reforged"},"summary":"Oret gathers amber and places it around a dead tree, preserving Anafenza as a warrior spirit.","participants":["oret","anafenza"],"location":null,"importance":"minor","page":"wiki/oret","order":1552,"story_date":"","storyline":"Tarkir: Dragonstorm","source":"mtg-wiki","paragraph":6,"quote":"Oret ensured that Anafenza lived on as a fierce kin-tree warrior spirit.","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Oret#:~:text=Oret%20ensured%20that%20Anafenza,fierce%20kin%2Dtree%20warrior%20spirit.","citation":{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Oret","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Oret","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Oret#:~:text=Oret%20ensured%20that%20Anafenza,fierce%20kin%2Dtree%20warrior%20spirit.","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors","text":"\"Oret\", section \"Current timeline\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, MTG Wiki contributors."}},{"id":"tarkir-timeline-e7","era":{"date":"2015-03-27","era":"dtk","label":"Dragons of Tarkir"},"summary":"Anafenza is executed by Oret; Sidisi is killed and resurrected as a sibsig vizier to Silumgar.","participants":["anafenza","oret","sidisi","silumga