 the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=It%20passed%20through%20him%2C,lifeless%20in%20the%20dust.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}},{"id":"guardian-2015-04-02-e3","era":null,"summary":"Anafenza leads Oret to a kin-tree in a dead-end chamber, revealing that amber vessels and the carved tree anchor ancestor spirits.","participants":["anafenza","oret","kin-tree"],"location":"canyon-chamber","importance":"major","page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":458,"story_date":"2015-04-02","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":62,"quote":"Spirits can be carried in amber, but I believe the tree is their anchor.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=Spirits%20can%20be%20carried,tree%20is%20their%20anchor.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Guardian","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Ari Levitch"],"date":"2015-04-02","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/guardian-2015-04-02#:~:text=Spirits%20can%20be%20carried,tree%20is%20their%20anchor.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Guardian\" by Ari Levitch. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 2 Apr 2015."}},{"id":"guardian-2015-04-02-e7","era":null,"summary":"Oret's scalelord lands in the chamber, crushing the kin-tree and learning of Anafenza's necromancy.","participants":["oret-s-scalelord","anafenza","oret","kin-tree"],"location":"canyon-chamber","importance":"major","page":"stories/guardian-2015-04-02","order":458,"story_date":"2015-04-02","storyline":"Dragons of Tarkir","source":"wizards","paragraph":